			"Message": "refactor(Mountain): Eliminate Air module wrappers and inline address constant\n\nRemove the remaining local re-export surface in Source/Air/ by deleting the dead AirServiceTypesStub module and consolidating AirClient.rs to only the MapAirError translation function and type alias. The DEFAULT_AIR_SERVER_ADDRESS constant is now referenced directly from ::AirLibrary::Client::AirClient in GetAirAddress.rs rather than via the local wrapper.\n\nThis completes the migration to absolute-path delegation for the Air integration layer, ensuring Mountain references the canonical Air library definitions without local indirection. The AirClient module now contains only the error translation boundary logic needed for CommonError propagation.",
